+ * (sandbox-controlled) `Array.prototype` chain. A sandbox-installed setter on
+ * `Array.prototype[N]`, fired before a host call (e.g. `new Buffer(a)` with a
+ * sandbox array `a`), captured the raw record `c` whose `arr` field is the
+ * host-realm proxy of the argument array, then walked
